  ('35f15e4d-4728-5e99-ae86-ebaf7b74fccd', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g11-connections'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Which statement best explains how the purpose of the weather network developed across the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A government project to study the climate was later handed to a teacher to run with volunteers.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-sequence"},{"text":"A tool planned from the start as a climate archive was later used to warn farmers about storms.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-sequence"},{"text":"A warning system failed to protect harvests and was then turned into a record of daily weather.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"A tool to warn farmers grew, standardized as it expanded, and that standardization later made it a climate record.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A tool to warn farmers grew, standardized as it expanded, and that standardization later made it a climate record.$q$, $q$The network began to give storm warnings (paragraph 3), its success forced standard instruments (paragraph 4), and "in turn" those consistent records became a climate archive (paragraph 5). The warnings worked, so the system did not fail before changing purpose.$q$, 'draft', 'fab22f71-36b4-55c1-9d0f-54ad054563db')
